 ratings)\n   - Competition queries (standings by season, schedules)\n   - Statistical analysis (goals per match, trends, head-to-head, home/away)\n4. Handle team name variations, multiple date formats, UTF-8\n5. Testing with BDD scenarios\n\nLet me first explore the current directory structure and look at the data files.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05a99d0a3001NJTuNFFN9cXC1s","sessionID":"ses_fa566b1a7ffetmaN0ZgRQlI0ol","messageID":"msg_05a99ad3f001KTxaEaLwfpOx56"}}
