es.\n- Gabriel Barbosa NOT in FIFA data (it's FIFA 19). Fine — tools handle empty gracefully.\n- Fla-Flu: 34 matches in novo (2003-2019, includes 2 games/season... 17 seasons × 2 = 34 ✓), 22 in bras (2012-2022, 11×2 = 22 ✓).\n\nMCP v2: `server.run(transport='stdio')`, ClientSession available for in-memory testing. How to create in-memory client-server pair? In mcp v1 there was `mcp.shared.memory.create_client_server_memory_streams`. Let me check for that in v2. Also check how `MCPServer.tool()` decorator works with async/sync functions, and structured output.\n\nLet me check memory streams helper.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05a9ea2e5001Bm9lL70JcWO63l","sessionID":"ses_fa566b1a7ffetmaN0ZgRQlI0ol","messageID":"msg_05a9e6eca001pTCh965LbrEOL9"}}
