  \"home\": home.to_dict(),\n         \"away\": away.to_dict(),\n         \"by_competition\": [\n-            by_competition[name].to_dict()\n+            {\"competition\": name, **by_competition[name].to_dict()}\n             for name in ALL_COMPETITIONS\n             if name in by_competition\n         ],\n         \"by_season\": [\n-            by_season[year].to_dict() for year in sorted(by_season, reverse=True)\n+            {\"season\": year, **by_season[year].to_dict()}\n+            for year in sorted(by_season, reverse=True)\n         ],\n     }\n \n def standings(self, season: int, competition: str = SERIE_A) -> dict | None:\n","filediff":{"file":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-ce22193d1e90/src/brasil_mcp/store.py","patch":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-ce22193d1e90/src/brasil_mcp/store.py\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-ce22193d1e90/src/brasil_mcp/store.py\n+++ /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-ce22193d1e90/src/brasil_mcp/store.py\n@@ -337,14 +337,15 @@\n         \"overall\": overall.to_dict(),\n         \"home\": home.to_dict(),\n         \"away\": away.to_dict(),\n         \"by_competition\": [\n-            by_competition[name].to_dict()\n+            {\"competition\": name, **by_competition[name].to_dict()}\n             for name in ALL_COMPETITIONS\n             if name in by_competition\n         ],\n         \"by_season\": [\n-            by_season[year].to_dict() for year in sorted(by_season, reverse=True)\n+            {\"season\": year, **by_season[year].to_dict()}\n+            for year in sorted(by_season, reverse=True)\n         ],\n     }\n \n def standings(self, season: int, competition: str = SERIE_A) -> dict | None:\n","additions":3,"deletions":2},"truncated":false},"title":"src/brasil_mcp/store.py","time":{"start":1788227481748,"end":1788227481750}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I made a mess in `team_stats` formatting — there's a broken leftover block with placeholder junk:\n\n```python\n    if stats[\"by_competition\"]:\n        lines.append(\"By competition:\")\n        for comp in stats[\"by_competition\"]:\n            lines.append(\n                f\"- {comp['matches'] and comp['team'] and comp['matches']} \"  # placeholder replaced below\n            )\n        lines = lines[:-len(stats[\"by_competition\"])]\n        ...\n```\n\nThat's garbage. Let me clean it. Also `by_competition` records don't carry the competition name — `TeamRecord.to_dict()` has no competition field! I need the competition names. In store.team_stats, by_competition is a dict keyed by competition name; the returned list loses the key. Fix: return list of dicts with competition name + record. Let me update store.team_stats to produce `by_competition: [{\"competition\": name, **record.to_dict()}]` and same for by_season (season key included? to_dict has no season... by_season list sorted desc — add season key).\n\nLet me fix store.team_stats accordingly and rewrite the team_stats query function cleanly.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05aa9f089001k08pM2FsMsaOap","sessionID":"ses_fa566b1a7ffetmaN0ZgRQlI0ol","messageID":"msg_05aa9bf100018Y0cH8q8U0i21P"}}
