on't pair-match bras 2012 at all — different teams?!\n\nOH WAIT. I bet I know what it is: novo's 2012 season — the Ano column. Maybe novo 2012 includes matches that bras 2012 lacks... no, both should be full 380.\n\nHmm, alternatively — the +38 could be pairings that differ due to TEAM NAME resolution differences! E.g., novo 'Sport' vs bras 'Sport-PE' resolving differently, or 'Athletico-PR' vs 'Atletico-PR'... If one name resolves to a different canonical, the pairing key won't match. 38 matches ≈ 2 teams × 19 home games! Two teams' names resolving differently → all their bras matches wouldn't merge with novo → +38 (19 home games each for 2 teams... hmm 38 = 2×19 or 1×38?).\n\nWait no — if a team name resolves the same in both files, pairing matches. If NOVO 'Guarani' → guarani-sp and BRAS 'Guarani-SP' → guarani-sp — same ✓. Let me check which 2012 matches exist in novo but whose pairing isn't in bras 2012.\n\nLet me diff the pairing sets per season between sources.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05ab011dc001NqhxnCvODGeH5Y","sessionID":"ses_fa566b1a7ffetmaN0ZgRQlI0ol","messageID":"msg_05aafd006001zQDnYPBeojpmMV"}}
