h club resolving to boavista-rj: FIFA 'Boavista' players resolve club → 'boavista-rj' — they'd MATCH ✗. The _players_by_club exclusion doesn't affect player_search's own resolution. Fix in _resolve_club_filter: it resolves player.club directly. I need the same FOREIGN_FIFA_CLUBS exclusion there. Let me update _resolve_club_filter to skip foreign clubs.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05abd29700014ZmQZf3IgOCWme","sessionID":"ses_fa566b1a7ffetmaN0ZgRQlI0ol","messageID":"msg_05abcf5f80013bLXaNVJiC0E7V"}}
