splay: most frequent suffixed raw: brf uses 'Atletico Goianiense'... So display(atletico-go) = 'Atletico Goianiense'. Earlier display showed 'Atletico-GO'? In the earlier run (before alias fix) there were two canonicals. Now merged → display picked 'Atletico Goianiense' (brf frequency high in Série B/C).\n\nThe TEST expectation was wrong (I wrote 'Atlético-GO'). Fix the test to match data: relegated 2022 = {'Ceará', 'Atletico Goianiense', 'Avaí', 'Juventude'}. But display aesthetics: 'Atletico Goianiense' — hmm, prefer 'Atlético-GO'. Add PREFERRED_DISPLAYS entry: 'atletico-go' → 'Atlético-GO'. That's cleaner for tables. Let me add it and fix the test to 'Atlético-GO'.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05ac3f71d001SZc3tYwjpWiJgH","sessionID":"ses_fa566b1a7ffetmaN0ZgRQlI0ol","messageID":"msg_05ac3b86300148hlxGUh9r20Hx"}}
