petition=\"Série A\" gave 37. Fix the case to include competition=\"Série A\" or change expectation. I'll add competition filter.\n10. test_brazilian_clubs_with_squads — fix FOREIGN set to 'Boavista FC'; then Boavista gone.\n\nFor suggest() — add difflib fallback:\n```python\ndef suggest(self, query, limit=8):\n    # existing containment scoring; if empty, difflib.get_close_matches over display names/bases\n```\nActually make it: containment first; then difflib close matches on known raw names (casefold) with cutoff 0.6, mapping back to canonicals.\n\nAlso fix the sample-question 'relegated-2019' etc. — those passed. Let me apply all fixes.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05ac6b9ca001JpBQTl1V7nmj9w","sessionID":"ses_fa566b1a7ffetmaN0ZgRQlI0ol","messageID":"msg_05ac6705f001mekmpslufmEKYT"}}
