otal = 552+552+462+380×13+380×... let me sum: 2003:552, 2004:552, 2005:462, 2006-2022: 380×17 = 6460, 2023: 377 → total 8403 + 1 (2015 phantom) = 8404 ✓ CURRENT state is correct! The earlier \"9629\" was from BEFORE the alias fixes (when Vasco dupes etc. remained). So current Série A = 8404 is CORRECT and my test threshold (>9000) was written from the buggy intermediate state. Same for CdB: current 1690 — let me sanity check: cup file 1337 + brf CdB 1123 = 2460 raw; dedupe: brf CdB 2014-2021 overlap with cup file... 2460-1690 = 770 merged. Plausible (brf CdB covers 2014-2023, cup file 2012-2021; overlap 2014-2021, most rounds shared). OK so current values are correct; fix the test thresholds: Série A > 8000, CdB > 1500.\n\nAnd the CdB \"matches > 2000\" in test_season_coverage → >1500.\n\nAlso fix test_server.py message assertion.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05ac94c830011Jg7JuHWmLr3av","sessionID":"ses_fa566b1a7ffetmaN0ZgRQlI0ol","messageID":"msg_05ac8ff45001o0YreFUVmU8qKD"}}
